    Fix cleartext HTTP being blocked on physical devices in debug builds
    
    <debug-overrides> in a shared network_security_config.xml didn't
    reliably enable cleartext traffic at runtime on all devices (observed
    via Logcat: CLEARTEXT communication ... not permitted, despite the
    app being debuggable). Moving the config into debug/release variant
    source sets makes cleartext permission a build-time property instead
    of a runtime debug-flag check, so it's guaranteed to apply in debug
    builds and stay disabled in release.

